<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JUNE INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT VOLUME UP 5.4PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JUNE INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT VOLUME UP 5.4PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's June industrial output rose 5.4 percent from May and 16.9 percent from a year ago, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The KSH said industrial output in the first six months was up 7.8 percent from the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom 361 327 4040</p>
</text>
